            'body'     => "## Our rule\n{sla}\n\nA new enquiry is at its hottest the moment it arrives — they are on your website, thinking about horses, phone in hand. An hour later they are cooking dinner. Tomorrow they have enquired at two other academies.\n\n> 🎯 The first academy to call almost always wins, even when it is not the best or the cheapest one.\n\n## What \"overdue\" means on your queue\nYour lead list shows an overdue count in red. That number is not an inbox — it is money sitting in a queue.\n\n- 🔴 **Overdue** — the promised follow-up time has passed. Clear these first, always.\n- 🟡 **Due today** — work these next.\n- ⚪ **Later** — leave them alone until their day.\n\n## Work order that actually converts\n1. Overdue follow-ups — oldest first\n2. Brand-new leads that have never been called\n3. Visits happening in the next two days — confirm them\n4. Today's scheduled follow-ups\n5. Everything else\n\n!> Never cherry-pick the easy leads and let the awkward ones rot. An old, unworked lead is the most expensive thing in the business — it was paid for and never used.\n\n## If they do not pick up\nCall, do not just message. Three attempts across different times of day before you downgrade the lead — morning, lunchtime, evening. People are not ignoring you, they are simply busy at the same time every day.",
